      "paperId": "5a277d94dcda14a1edc7855434a3247d94d7a93c",
      "title": "Plekh\u00e1nov e a cr\u00edtica est\u00e9tica marxista: entre a inten\u00e7\u00e3o e o gesto",
      "authors": [
